        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-prepositions-p11-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "与 + participant",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "与 + participant can introduce the other side of a relationship. Here it does not merely join two independent clauses.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我与他一起工作。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǔ tā yīqǐ gōngzuò 。",
                "meaning": "I work together with him.",
                "audio": "e985fd640b269f6f9f2edb80037e3d20e8e1f7feecad22e578bcc3db0313932f"
              },
              {
                "text": "这件事与我有关。",
                "pinyin": "zhè jiàn shì yǔ wǒ yǒuguān 。",
                "meaning": "This matter concerns me.",
                "audio": "160f0b5868b655c30473b15ec3178bcbb9a4733ee3ff42ae0b360b61c5b0e001"
              }
            ]
